An `INTERNAL_MAP_TERMINAL_EVENT` system line is a local-wrapper completion in this owning conversation, even when delivered with a generic heartbeat prompt or disabled outward delivery. Handle its saved action and evidence before scheduled-launch or launcher-notice classification. It grants no new scope or spending. Do not create a new heartbeat conversation for it. Preserve a durable result in private state even if outward delivery is suppressed.

