- Read fresh control and the queue's `items`, not just `next`. A paid `inspect`/`start` entry blocked on MAP-IMPORT-BUDGET does not block independent `action="verify"` entries: select the first compatible verification and use its exact `run_args` with all three budgets zero. Never resume a paid run with zero budgets and call it provider-free. If no verification is eligible, perform one bounded source review or delegate an evidenced code blocker. Carry the unchanged monetary question forward once; do not let it stall all backlog work.
