- On the automatic `INTERNAL_MAP_TERMINAL_EVENT` system event containing `map-terminal-preflight:...`, handle the saved action in this same owner. Read the exact preflight and callback evidence, verify marker/owner/Gateway/exit, the recorded positive enqueue acknowledgement and exact event identity, and actual automatic continuation, write the witnessed receipt using the schema in `/Users/pshorey/git/openclaw/README.md`, and check it with `--check --owner-session`. This callback is neither a scheduled heartbeat nor a completed import. Then recheck control/queue compatibility and launch the saved eligible import in this turn; use native exec as the last tool call and end. If any check fails, mark the specific blocker and delegate a technical repair where authorized. Never fabricate proof.
