Use ordinary replies only in the standard dashboard/mobile conversation that owns the work. New conversation means an independent request. Historical routing instructions do not override this policy. `sessions_send` starts a turn; it is not a transcript-append API. A background event is not a new heartbeat. If an old owning conversation is unavailable, create one clearly labeled follow-up and record the link; do not rerun the job. The transient launcher alone returns `NO_REPLY` after dispatch or a redundant child completion.

